      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing torn and uneven pin tails. One possible cause is that the chisel is too small or the grain direction isn't optimal. Try using a larger chisel and making sure the warn curve of the cut matches the desired pin tail profile, adjusting your cut direction as needed. Additionally, pay attention to how sharp your chisel is - dull chisels are more prone to tearing out.",
